@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #2C3E50

component "Terminal Application" as App
component "Card Extensions\n(e.g. Calypso Card API)" as Ext
component "Terminal Reader API\n(this specification)" as TR #LightYellow
component "Terminal Definitions API\n(global constants)" as Def
component "Reader Driver\nImplementation(s)" as Drv
component "Card Reader\nHardware" as HW

App --> TR  : uses
App --> Def : uses (transitive)
Ext  --> TR : extends (SPI)
TR   --> Def : depends on
TR   --> Drv : delegated to
Drv  --> HW  : controls
@enduml
